# Γράφημα διασποράς

## Απλό 


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data=mpg)+geom_point(mapping=aes(x=displ, y=hwy))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


## Αισθητικές παρεμβάσεις


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data=mpg)+geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy, color=class))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg)+geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy, size = cyl))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy, shape = class))
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
Warning: The shape palette can deal with a maximum of 6 discrete values because more
than 6 becomes difficult to discriminate
ℹ you have requested 7 values. Consider specifying shapes manually if you need
  that many of them.
```


:::

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
Warning: Removed 62 rows containing missing values or values outside the scale range
(`geom_point()`).
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


## Όψεις


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy))+facet_wrap(~ class, nrow=2)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy)) + facet_grid(drv~cyl)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-8-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y = hwy)) + facet_grid(drv ~.)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-9-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy)) + facet_grid(.~ cyl)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-10-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


# Καμπύλη παλινδρόμησης

## Μεμονομένη


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_smooth(mapping = aes(x=displ, y = hwy))
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
`geom_smooth()` using method = 'loess' and formula = 'y ~ x'
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-11-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


## Με συνδυασμούς


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_smooth(mapping = aes(x= displ, y=hwy, linetype = drv, color = drv)) +geom_point(mapping = aes(x= displ, y= hwy, color = drv))
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
`geom_smooth()` using method = 'loess' and formula = 'y ~ x'
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-12-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg, mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy)) + geom_point(aes(color=class)) + geom_smooth(aes(linetype = drv)) 
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
`geom_smooth()` using method = 'loess' and formula = 'y ~ x'
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-13-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


## Φιλτράρισμα


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg, mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy)) + geom_point(aes(colour = class)) + geom_smooth(data = filter(mpg, class=="subcompact"), se = F)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
`geom_smooth()` using method = 'loess' and formula = 'y ~ x'
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-14-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


