# Jitter


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_point(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy), position = "jitter")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-27-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_jitter(mapping = aes(x=displ, y=hwy))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-28-1.png){width=672}
:::
