# Θηκόγραμμα

## Απλό


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_boxplot(mapping = aes(x=class, y=hwy))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-29-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


## Αντιστροφή συντεταγμένων



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg) + geom_boxplot(mapping = aes(x=class, y=hwy)) +coord_flip()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-30-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


## Με jitter


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data = mpg, mapping = aes(x=class, y=hwy)) + geom_boxplot(outliers=F) + geom_jitter()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](1optikopoiisi_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-31-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



